# The lesson end to end: Play on a fresh save opens its rules card, Begin, the
# countdown, then every requested object by the arrow keys and Enter (the
# first arrow is the look-around step), a hint before the last find; the
# results (total 1600), the progress screen and the title with "Replay lesson".
# Generated by tools/gen-plays.mjs.
until 300 Hidden Nook
frames 60
save title
click Play (starts with a quick lesson)
until 60 Interactive lesson
frames 10
save lesson-setup
click =Begin
until 400 =Pause
frames 20
expect Lesson 1/5
save lesson-round
# find speckled lantern
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
# find rusty feather
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
# find teal spool of thread
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
# find copper bottle
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
# find ivory pencil
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
# a hint
key KeyH 1
frames 10
# find wooden teapot
key ArrowRight 1
frames 5
key Enter 1
frames 10
until 120 Nook cleared!
frames 30
expect 1600
expect First Light
save lesson-results
click =Menu
until 60 Objects found all-time
frames 10
save progress
click =Back to title
until 60 Replay lesson
frames 10
expect Play
